### Auth: Login
POST http://localhost:5265/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin+1@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Auth: Register
POST http://localhost:5265/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin+1@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@123",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Auth: Me
GET http://localhost:5265/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{"token"}}
Accept: application/json

### Lead Statuses: Get all
GET http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses
Accept: application/json

### Lead Statuses: Get by id
GET http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses/{id}
Accept: application/json

### Lead Statuses: Create
POST http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Qualified",
  "color": "#2ECC71",
  "isActive": true
}

### Lead Statuses: Update
PUT http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses/{id}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Qualified Lead",
  "color": "#27AE60"
}

### Lead Statuses: Delete
DELETE http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses/{id}
Accept: application/json

### Lead Statuses: Restore
POST http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses/{id}/restore
Accept: application/json

### Roles: Get all
GET http://localhost:5265/api/roles
Accept: application/json

### Roles: Get by id
GET http://localhost:5265/api/roles/{id}
Accept: application/json

### Roles: Create
POST http://localhost:5265/api/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin",
  "description": "System administrator",
  "isDefault": false,
  "isProtected": true,
  "isActive": true
}

### Roles: Delete
DELETE http://localhost:5265/api/roles/{id}
Accept: application/json

### Roles: Restore
POST http://localhost:5265/api/roles/{id}/restore
Accept: application/json
